        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm not involved in Spirit Island due to traveling. I also consider that last year's project. I was focusing on SotM and Tactics.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's still a playtesting project, and it's definitely being tested in 2015. It totally counts.</p>",
